# AUDIT #134 CLEANUP — independent-review fix pass (this stage).
#
# cases/templates/cases/case_detail.html's "Current owner" field (added by an
# earlier stage this round, backed by cases/models.py::Case.current_owner())
# had NO catalog entry at all — the {% trans %} tag itself was already
# correct, but with nothing in this file to translate it, gettext silently
# falls back to the raw English msgid, so the field read "Current owner" in
# an otherwise fully-Persian details panel. Confirmed live and reported by
# the independent reviewer (case 14, Persian). Same class of gap as the
# "Cannot submit to Supply" catalog entries earlier in this file — the
# template was right, only the catalog was missing.
#
# "دارندهٔ فعلی" ("current holder"), not "مالک فعلی" ("current owner"/
