# beyond the existing plain-parse and (TaskForm only) work-shift-hours
# checks — see that function's own docstring for the full reasoning and why
# it lives one level up from marketing/forms.py::_clean_jalali_datetime
# rather than inside it.
#
# The "no work-shift window" fallback line inside the always-visible hour
# boxes is a GENUINE NEW STRING, not a re-translation of the existing
# "...Today's reminders are shown as one list instead." msgid a few hundred
# lines above this section — that older msgid is left exactly as it was,
# unused now but kept per this catalog's own stated convention ("left in
# this catalog unused rather than deleted, same as every other retired
# string here"), because the hour-box treatment it described is no longer
# Today-only (see marketing/views.py::_task_hour_groups_for_day) and the
